        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Hotham Alpine Resort, Mount Hotham, Melbourne, Sydney, Adelaide, Charlotte Pass, New South Wales\n- Topics: ski resorts, alpine villages, altitude, road distance\n\nFacts:\n- Hotham Alpine Resort is set on the slopes of Mount Hotham.\n- Hotham Alpine Resort comprises an alpine village at an altitude of 1750 metres.\n- Hotham Alpine Resort is the second highest resort village in Australia after Charlotte Pass village in New South Wales.\n- Mount Hotham is located approximately 357 kilometres northeast of Melbourne by road.\n- Mount Hotham is located approximately 746 kilometres from Sydney by road.\n- Mount Hotham is located approximately 997 kilometres from Adelaide by road.",
